# Add new jewellery type
```
1. Drop the image file into assets/images/jewellery_type/ — no pubspec.yaml change needed, since that whole folder is already declared as an asset directory (pubspec.yaml:86), so any file placed there is picked up automatically.

2. Register the key in lib/widgets/jewellery_type_icon.dart:

Add an entry to _assetMap — 'yourKey': 'assets/images/jewellery_type/your-file.png'
Add the same key to validKeys (its position there is the display order in the icon-picker grid)
That's it for making a new icon selectable in the picker (management page's "add/edit jewellery type" dialog) and rendered anywhere JewelleryTypeIcon is used.

Optional 3rd step — only if you also want it pre-seeded as a default jewellery type (like Ring/Pendant/etc. rather than something a user manually creates): add an entry to assets/data/init_jewellery_types.json with a matching iconKey. Since that file only seeds data on first app install/fresh Hive box, existing installs (including your own test device) won't automatically pick up new entries added there later — that'd need a small migration/backfill if you go this route for future types, similar to GoldPriceHistoryBackfillService 
```


# Deployment for production

```
# 1. 合并 develop 进 main，处理完冲突
git checkout main
git pull origin main
git merge develop
# ...解决冲突、git add、git commit（如果有冲突的话）...
git push origin main

# 2. 确认 main 现在的 HEAD 就是你想发布的那个 commit
git log -1 --oneline main

# 3. 确认无误后才打 tag（此时 tag 会指向刚 push 上去的那个 commit）
git tag v1.0.4
git push origin v1.0.4    # 这一步才会真正触发 release-prod.yml
```
